{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c62c231174070417f173d115e8c972f7b58a74dfc616516b6b3b9df7cfe477c6", "ja": "（星梨花たちが出演した『おとぎの国の物語』は\n公開後も好評。各地で舞台挨拶が続いている……）", "zh": "（星梨花她们参与演出的《童话王国的故事》，\n在上映后也大获好评，持续在各地举办见面会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1001_p", "source_sha256": "47c626eca30709cfaa337e8a9b681a5f38d5578154ff0605533709e01c505ef3", "ja": "よし、これで書類整理は終わりだ。今日の舞台挨拶まで\nまだ時間があるな……少し、仮眠しておくか。", "zh": "好，这样文件就整理好了。\n距离今天的见面会还有一点时间……来小睡一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "4bf9baec98fc3435a87f5c7f7b9d70f2816e63dea1958b92bce83b3770b96390", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n{$P$}さん、起きてください。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n{$P$}先生，请起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0d97fc921d129449a90c0f3b69e66276b7c716f9bd0d638a6033ace967b67e50", "ja": "星梨花……？　なんだ、どうしたんだ……って、あれ。\nごめん、もしかして寝ちゃってたか。", "zh": "星梨花……？怎么了，有什么事……咦，奇怪。\n抱歉，我该不会睡着了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "0274607333e4f4853e58662432e2280697e8020147b253dab5af489b6af4944b", "ja": "はい。どうしようかなって思ったんですけど……\nこんなところで寝てたら、カゼをひいちゃいますよ。", "zh": "是的，我还在想该怎么办才好呢……\n在这种地方睡着会感冒的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1006_p", "source_sha256": "98a82047da3b6d8cfae89956c0ed1109f795f72050af9291d409cda0dbb6815f", "ja": "いや、起こしてくれてありがとう。……あれ？\nでも確か、さっきまで事務室にいたような……。", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢你叫醒我……咦？\n不过到刚才为止，我应该在事务室才对啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "370d7cd1be0ad8d621a97b8ced6db7637d59711bce9ecdab76e1f4c528f91b55", "ja": "えっ？　{$P$}さん、\nもしかして忘れちゃったんですか？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}先生，\n你该不会忘记了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "3ba2af95462dd0fcae6377d395e6b838ccbab90afe1b169654ec9cc3225eced9", "ja": "わたしたち、ずっと一緒に歩いてきたんですよ。\nお城を目指して！", "zh": "我们一起朝着城堡前进，\n一直走到了这里喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "3b04a3e385ebcd156480d5034d1f881f6538e30035d198b195b12af99d5644fe", "ja": "さあ{$P$}さん、行きましょう！\n日が暮れる前に、お城につかないと。", "zh": "来吧，{$P$}先生，继续前进！\n必须在太阳下山前抵达城堡才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1010_p", "source_sha256": "961d0806d2fdeb0b319f1914a00d3db71a0043fa4dd370032cb8954a0fb7f44f", "ja": "お城……そうだったっけか。\nところで、お城で何をするんだ？", "zh": "城堡……是这样吗？\n话说回来，我们要去城堡做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "6bf536a05e1f4c419fbc872c9062721fd68b67d9ce3cb3c60fd17ec4913635dc", "ja": "もちろん映画の舞台挨拶ですよ！\nみなさんが、楽しみに待っていてくれるんです。", "zh": "当然是去出席电影的见面会呀！\n大家都满心期待在等着我们喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "ef0ea099054a94889aa091ca31ca65232e5dd4a90ce5244a52f4265a3f5b8148", "ja": "わたし、いつもはアイドルとして、\n歌ったり、踊ったりしてますけど……。", "zh": "我一直以来总是作为一位偶像唱歌、跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "2377f50ae224ffb234400d8074a2f67c1576040660eaf94a41d8a517a449b956", "ja": "お芝居のお仕事は、アイドルのステージとは\n全然違って、でもとっても楽しかったです！", "zh": "演戏的工作虽然和偶像的表演完全不同，\n但我在拍摄时也觉得非常开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1014_p", "source_sha256": "057afebe61543848373172a3f3957e87a27cbd4e292265140970b85d4627f387", "ja": "そうか。\n今度の仕事は、いい経験になったか？", "zh": "这样啊。\n这次的工作，对你来说是个很好的经验吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "bd0c66cd6e77d53032cba8ecfa0ce1f20dac516a65a28d018d328c7fd74a7841", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さん、わたしに楽しい\nお仕事をさせてくれて、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "是的！{$P$}先生，\n谢谢你为我接了这份有趣的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "46ac8400ed78d91716b781da119ce5851ccba1f155be1f5dee59c4280e583bb5", "ja": "わたし、これからもいろんな経験がしたいです！\n{$P$}さんと一緒に……えへへ♪", "zh": "我今后，也想要体验各式各样的事物！\n跟{$P$}先生一起体验……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "1b92747da53096794a9d8b1f298ef41f7c1efb687ad9a2faf59ad86ada7414c0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、起きてください。\nカゼをひいちゃいますよ？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请起来。\n这样会感冒的喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1019_p", "source_sha256": "56cee5445da07a51db1c35b8583d148afa0837bca2bd5eb5d84984a3ce3d5698", "ja": "ん、んん……あ、あれ？　星梨花？\nそうか、今のは夢だったのか……ふわぁ……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯嗯……奇、奇怪？星梨花？\n这样啊，刚才那是梦啊……呼啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "26ec8000b0adea4a69a2bf4fffa23ec6028cd9a41406bbc24c3a0f2294fa3081", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れなんですか？\nちゃんとお休みしてくださいね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你累了吗？\n请你记得好好休息喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "d88b5d1daf3962db3a3215a035a58f1584d5dfc08e0e602d143076009d066afb", "ja": "今日の舞台挨拶なら、大丈夫ですよ。\nわたし、ひとりでも会場まで行けますから！", "zh": "今天的见面会你就不用操心了，\n我自己一个人也能前往会场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7bfea7f40273d60b5ebed055fe7530cbcbcc1fa041ea0729d5e54b63da739669", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。でももう大丈夫だよ。それに\nプロデューサーは、いつもアイドルと一緒でないとな。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你的关心，不过已经没问题了。\n而且制作人必须一直陪在偶像左右才行啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0143_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "c5d4a0655dabd9632f31761326ad20b25d05174edcae3f55e0d9d071ca3c2053", "ja": "{$P$}さん……えへへ。\nそれじゃ、一緒にみなさんに会いに行きましょう！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿。\n那我们一起去见大家吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
